  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Veritas lends to over 12,000 micro, small and medium-sized enterprise (MSME) customers in rural and semi-urban areas.&#xa0; It provides small individual loans for working capital and business expansion. Veritas currently operates more than 100 branches across Tamil Nadu, Puducherry, Karnataka, West Bengal and Odisha. Lok IV invested $14.6m.</narrative>
  </description>
